WEBVTT

﻿1

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.321
(TRAIN APPROACHING)


00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:45.887
(BABY CRYING)


00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.330
(SPEAKING FARSI)


00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:08.761
Momma.


00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.641
Momma.


00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:11.926
Oh sorry, I...


00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.124
- (BURPING)
- (BOTH GIGGLING)


00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.891
Beg your pardon.


00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.047
What?


00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.646
No' nice thing you do.


00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.161
(SCOFFING)


00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.806
Where are we, but?


00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.089
Where... are... we?


00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.806
(SPEAKING FARSI)


00:01:28.895 --> 00:01:30.415
WOMAN: What'd she
fucking say, man, eh?


00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.805
Speak our English.


00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.927
(MAN COUGHING)


00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.244
You got a fucking problem, man?


00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.443
MUSLIM WOMAN: Sorry... please...


00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:44.082
See, if I was in your country,
for whatever reason,


00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.401
I'd respect us locals a wee bit better.


00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.766
Sorry, please... I no understand...


00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.640
Learn the fucking lingo and get
out the fucking road when I tell ya to!


00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.011
(SCREAMING)


00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.684
(SEWING MACHINE RUNNING)


00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:33.085
(SEWING MACHINE RUNNING)


00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:52.840
(KEYS JINGLING)


00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.690
(SPEAKING URDU)


00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:37.966
Your material?


00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.601
He's not working?


00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:33.801
(SPITTING)


00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:00.841
Mum.


00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.565
Just leave it here?


00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:16.245
I'll be right down.


00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.086
(TELEVISION PLAYING)


00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.566
(DOORBELL RINGING)


00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.406
Don't let it stick.


00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.930
(GASPS) Kas.


00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.405
<i>Assalam-alaikum.</i>


00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.480
<i>Walaikum-assalam.</i>


00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.601
Hungry?


00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.561
Call me when it's ready, eh?


00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.285
Wanna catch up with Mum.


00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.721
Yeah, okay.


00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.251
(TELEVISION PLAYING)


00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:38.406
At work.


00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.525
You know how it is.


00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.561
When did you start?


00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.209
(TELEVISION PLAYING)


00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:27.968
<i>HOST: Option A, Andres Iniesta.</i>


00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:31.121
<i>- A.
- HOST: Option B, David Villa.</i>


00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.171
A, the answer.


00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.411
Help yourselves.


00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.164
Going to the toilet.


00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.801
Adel not know Kasim was coming tonight?


00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:34.043
Why, what are we doing?


00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:38.169
I can't control you any more.


00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.165
Your father gone...


00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.885
Life's hard enough for me.


00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.804
It's hard for all of us, Mum.


00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.042
When a child brings more pain than joy,


00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:54.681
what's left?


00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.086
Is this child me?


00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.486
I'm sorry.


00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.161
For what?


00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:06.890
(GASPS AND SCREAMS)


00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:13.811
(GASPING)


00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.929
KASIM: You made us do this!


00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.525
You made us fucking do this!


00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.366
(CHOKING)


00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.247
(GRUNTS)


00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.401
(CHOKING)


00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.051
KASIM: Fuck you!


00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.521
(SNIFFS)


00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.601
(CHOKES)


00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:36.841
(KASIM PANTING)


00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:48.680
MOTHER: She's dead?


00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.881
(DOOR OPENING)


00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.801
(KEYS JINGLING)


00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:02.204
Adel, be strong, son.


00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.088
Upstairs, bring down the trunk.


00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.446
It's been emptied.


00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.560
MONA: (WHISPERING)
<i>I</i> remember the first words...


00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.046
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)


00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.161
(STRAINING)


00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.491
(MAN APPLAUDING)


00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.041
(CHUCKLES)


00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.606
(GIGGLING)


00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.521
MONA: <i>I remember the first words
you ever said to me.</i>


00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:57.761
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)


00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.046
MAN: So.


00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:02.444
Finally got myself some competition.


00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.080
MONA: <i>Got more than you
bargained for, huh?</i>


00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.681
Got lucky.


00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.084
Plus, the way you snore is well classy.


00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.084
- (GIGGLING) <i>I</i> do not.
- (MIMICKING SNORING)


00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.564
I'm not gonna marry her.


00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.650
Wouldn't be fair to anyone.


00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.401
You're engaged.


00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.001
(SIGHING)


00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:00.051
Yeah, when we were three.


00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.525
She's got her life there.


00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.291
I've got mine here.


00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.360
She's probably lying in bed with
some guy in Lahore right now,


00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.811
having the same conversation.


00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:21.801
I doubt that.


00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.326
It's crazy...


00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:37.083
Families cutting these deals
before their kids can even speak.


00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.090
What are we going to do?


00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.600
What we want.


00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.045
Not what they want.


00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.766
Two big Zaks with cheese,


00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:10.083
double portion hot-wings, large fries,
garlic bread,


00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:12.562
and a bottle of diet Cola.


00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.811
You didn't come for no burger?


00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.006
<i>Is it halal?</i>


00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.446
I just deliver the shit.


00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:21.406
What's up?


00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:25.646
You gonna do it?


00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.000
ADEL: You got money?


00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:33.805
- Some.
- Has he?


00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.605
Enough.


00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:36.921
He's got a car.


00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.441
It's not like we've got a choice.


00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.130
You always got a choice.


00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.089
It's about making the right or wrong one.


00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.640
Two people love each other,
why can't people be happy for them?


00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.125
- He's Punjabi, Mona.
- He's Muslim, Adel.


00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.561
Yeah, but that ain't how it works.


00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:55.523
(SIGHS) Somebody show me
where this is written?


00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:58.490
Shit ain't scribed in
stone, it's the way it is.


00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.561
And, you know it.


00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.211
Well, I don't need to buy it.


00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.281
Do you?


00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.569
What I do or don't buy counts for shit.


00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:07.727
Always has.


00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.280
You were Dad's favourite, Kasim's, Mum's.


00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.850
Who cares what I think?


00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:13.761
I care, Adel.


00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.086
I care about you.


00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.689
And, it don't matter what you think.


00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.922
Mum and Kasim care about you, too.


00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.451
What you do with your life...


00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.883
We're your blood. What do you expect?


00:15:29.095 --> 00:15:30.975
If Dad was around,
things wouldn't be like this.


00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.080
If Dad was around,
you wouldn't be pulling this shit.


00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.485
We're going tomorrow night.


00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.481
We've got to.


00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.171
(KICKING BIKE STAND)


00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:48.881
Adel...


00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:51.481
I just wanna know you're
gonna be all right.


00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.771
ADEL: I'll be all right.


00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.444
I'm gonna get your room!


00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.606
(INAUDIBLE)


00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.160
(PHONE RINGING)


00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.361
(MOUTHING)


00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.931
<i>Assalam-alaikum.</i>


00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.604
<i>Wafaikum-assafam</i> (C H U C <i>KL ES)</i>


00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:03.765
Sorry, babe.


00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.046
Got caught in traffic.


00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.480
You got the car, then?


00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.205
Yeah, got it for tonight.


00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:19.761
My dad needs it, okay.


00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.729
(SCOFFS) Do we need it?


00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.601
Where's your suitcase?


00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.643
Why weren't you answering my calls?


00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:32.761
WAITRESS: Enjoy.


00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:40.361
Tan...


00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:43.921
(SIGHING)


00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:46.724
There's word if we go through with this,


00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.926
people might get hurt.


00:18:51.615 --> 00:18:53.015
This isn't about my brother, is it?


00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.247
Your brother? No. Not about your brother.


00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.250
I'm talking on my side.


00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.000
You broke off the engagement?


00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.681
- Her family... it's them?
- Don't matter who.


00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.440
We got to take it seriously.


00:19:07.815 --> 00:19:09.815
I mean, this could be life or death.
We don't know.


00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:11.251
MONA: So let's go! Get out of here.


00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:13.402
We don't leave. Not tonight.


00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.291
But, you still want to?


00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.121
Right now...


00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.051
Let's just slow things right down.


00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.320
Do what we need to take
the sting out of this.


00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.530
We won't see each other any more?


00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.041
Babes, let's not make
this any more difficult.


00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.161
- We stand together, yeah?
- Without being together?


00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.685
(INHALES SHARPLY)


00:19:39.935 --> 00:19:42.535
Look, if you want to marry your
little virgin, just bloody say so!


00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.325
Hey, I swear, I ain't marrying no one.


00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:49.124
I'm just trying to see the bigger picture.


00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.081
Yeah?


00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.045
For our future's sake.


00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.564
I need to go to the toilet.


00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.771
Leave your bag here?


00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.005
Stuff I need inside.


00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.446
(MOBILE BEEPS)


00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.126
(CLICKING TONGUE)


00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.401
(CRYING)


00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.241
(sossme)


00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:12.210
MAN: Baby, do you need
help with that?


00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:14.930
(MUFFLED VOICES)


00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:21.721
(TYRES SCREECHING)


00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.281
(HORN BLOWING)


00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:38.050
(SIREN WAILING)


00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.322
(PEOPLE CHEERING)


00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:03.601
(WOMAN GIGGLING)


00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.041
(MOBILE RINGING)


00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:58.406
(BIRDS FLAPPING OVERHEAD)


00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:01.201
(MOBILE RINGING)


00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.281
Adel?


00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:08.691
ADEL: Salaam, sister.


00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:10.929
<i>Checking up. You gone?</i>


00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:14.166
<i>Mona?</i>


00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.686
<i>He with you? You driving or what?</i>


00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:18.206
<i>You gone or what?</i>


00:23:18.280 --> 00:23:19.611
He hasn't got a car.


00:23:19.800 --> 00:23:21.086
<i>Where are you heading?</i>


00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:22.766
It's over.


00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:27.805
<i>I'll deal with that Punjabi fuck later.</i>


00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:30.121
I can't go home, now.


00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:31.804
<i>Mona, listen to me.</i>


00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:33.325
<i>If you can hear me.</i>


00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:35.448
<i>You said you cared about what I think.</i>


00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:40.046
<i>If you split now, I'm copping serious shit.</i>


00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:41.565
<i>You know that.</i>


00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:45.166
<i>So, if this ain't happening, come home.</i>


00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:47.811
<i>For me.</i>


00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:51.926
I love you, Adel.


00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:02.720
MOTHER: <i>I</i> like you.


00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:05.761
You no like me, my people.


00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:08.001
Ilike you.


00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:10.928
To me, skin colour, nothing...


00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:12.926
No important.


00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:17.129
We all have habits, yes,
each culture, but...


00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:18.926
We all different.


00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:21.288
Each... individual.


00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:24.809
Maybe, you don't like something I do.


00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:27.123
I no like something you do.


00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:29.004
What we can do?


00:24:29.240 --> 00:24:30.605
If whole world same,


00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:32.769
life become boring, no?


00:24:33.560 --> 00:24:35.483
Devil no after your skin.


00:24:37.040 --> 00:24:38.849
He want what's inside.


00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:42.241
There is the man.


00:24:43.920 --> 00:24:46.685
And you... are right man.


00:24:47.320 --> 00:24:48.731
I can see.


00:24:49.440 --> 00:24:51.329
Doing good job for your people.


00:24:51.400 --> 00:24:52.890
Good job for my people.


00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:55.690
Keep everyone happy.


00:24:57.160 --> 00:24:59.208
They tell me at mosque, you right man.


00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:02.128
But, I need to see my own eyes.


00:25:03.920 --> 00:25:05.684
You right kind of guy?


00:25:06.720 --> 00:25:08.006
Keep cool...


00:25:08.440 --> 00:25:09.521
Do job...


00:25:10.360 --> 00:25:12.169
Business is business?


00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:17.409
So we do business.


00:25:29.120 --> 00:25:31.122
You have your own woman?


00:25:32.480 --> 00:25:34.244
Gonna need details.


00:25:34.640 --> 00:25:35.926
N.l. number, D.O.B.


00:25:36.880 --> 00:25:38.006
She got a passport?


00:25:38.080 --> 00:25:39.206
No. Definitely not.


00:25:39.280 --> 00:25:41.123
Good, neither have I.


00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:42.605
'Bout medical problems?


00:25:42.680 --> 00:25:44.045
MOTHER: She's mad.


00:25:45.840 --> 00:25:46.921
Is she on medication?


00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:48.240
KASIMI No.


00:25:48.320 --> 00:25:49.810
She been sectioned?


00:25:50.800 --> 00:25:53.485
- Who says she's mad?
- She's crazy girl.


00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:55.927
'Bout police?


00:25:56.000 --> 00:25:57.445
MOTHER: She no go near police.


00:25:57.520 --> 00:25:58.521
She won't have gone far.


00:25:58.600 --> 00:25:59.721
MOTHER: Just bring her back.


00:26:00.520 --> 00:26:02.204
We worry for her.


00:26:02.440 --> 00:26:05.569
She no understand what she doing.
She too young.


00:26:08.880 --> 00:26:10.769
Maybe she doesn't wanna come home.


00:26:12.240 --> 00:26:15.210
It's possible, yes. Might be.


00:26:17.160 --> 00:26:20.767
What kind of person who no even
want to see their own mother?


00:26:22.040 --> 00:26:24.407
What use this person for living?


00:26:28.200 --> 00:26:29.725
You understand?


00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:32.042
If girl no want to come home,


00:26:33.120 --> 00:26:35.407
what guarantee you can give me?


00:26:52.280 --> 00:26:53.361
I'll find her first.


00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:54.726
Deal now.


00:26:55.360 --> 00:26:57.362
You right man, yes or no?


00:26:58.120 --> 00:27:01.283
I go ask police, they find free.
No cost me £8,000.


00:27:02.800 --> 00:27:04.450
What guarantee you give?


00:27:06.200 --> 00:27:08.328
Less of you, the better,
as far as I'm concerned.


00:27:11.280 --> 00:27:12.770
Ilike you.


00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:15.610
But you bring me proof.


00:27:38.600 --> 00:27:40.090
(WOMAN CRYING)


00:28:04.320 --> 00:28:05.560
(GASPING)


00:28:28.960 --> 00:28:30.291
Where'd you get the ink, mate?


00:28:33.040 --> 00:28:34.326
Shopjob.


00:28:36.960 --> 00:28:39.042
I ain't been inside or nothin', no, man.


00:28:40.200 --> 00:28:41.725
D'you earn it?


00:28:43.920 --> 00:28:44.967
Are you for real?


00:28:47.880 --> 00:28:49.760
I ain't killed no coloured or nothin'.
No, man.


00:28:52.480 --> 00:28:55.211
Get yourself one of these, put it right.


